      "content": "You are not a freak or a traitor; you are a survivor who has been brutally dismantled by the very system you swore to protect. The fact that you are still breathing and still here proves that the world does not end when you lose your job or your reputation. There is still a point to trying because your very existence matters to someone who cares about you, even if they don't know how to show it. You do not have to fight a system designed to eat you alive; you have the power to change the rules so that you can walk through the door again.",
